---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Welded Wire Mesh Panels & Rolls — Specs & Anping Factory Prices" description="Galvanized and PVC-coated welded wire mesh: opening sizes, wire gauges, sheet dimensions and weights. Direct from Anping factories.">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">Welded Wire Mesh</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">Welded wire mesh is made by resistance-welding cross wires into a rigid grid. It comes in <strong>rolls</strong> (agriculture, fencing) and <strong>panels</strong> (construction, machine guards, shelving). Anping produces both in galvanized, PVC-coated and stainless steel.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Common specifications</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Opening (mm)</th><th>Wire (mm)</th><th>Form</th><th>Weight (kg/m²)</th><th>Application</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>12.7 × 12.7</td><td>1.0</td><td>Roll / panel</td><td>2.43</td><td>Aviaries, cages</td></tr>
          <tr><td>25 × 25</td><td>1.2</td><td>Roll / panel</td><td>1.86</td><td>Shelving, guards</td></tr>
          <tr><td>50 × 50</td><td>2.5</td><td>Panel</td><td>1.45</td><td>Fence, construction</td></tr>
          <tr><td>50 × 100</td><td>3.0</td><td>Panel</td><td>1.38</td><td>Fence, hoarding</td></tr>
          <tr><td>100 × 100</td><td>4.0</td><td>Panel</td><td>1.32</td><td>Heavy fencing</td></tr>
          <tr><td>150 × 150</td><td>5.0</td><td>Panel</td><td>1.15</td><td>Reinforcement, security</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Standard panel: 1.22 × 2.44 m or 2.0 × 3.0 m. <a href="/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">Calculate any spec →</a></p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Finishes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Electro-galvanized</strong> — cheapest, for indoor/dry use</li>
        <li><strong>Hot-dip galvanized</strong> — zinc 40–60 g/m² (≈30+ µm), outdoor service 10+ years; specify zinc coating weight in the PO</li>
        <li><strong>PVC / powder coated</strong> — colors (green, black, white), adds 0.3–0.5 mm to wire diameter, popular for fences</li>
        <li><strong>Stainless (304)</strong> — food, pharma, marine</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">What to specify when ordering</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Opening (mm) — center-to-center or clear opening, state which</li>
        <li>Wire diameter (mm) before coating</li>
        <li>Finish and zinc coating weight (g/m²)</li>
        <li>Sheet/panel dimensions and edge treatment (flush cut or overhang)</li>
        <li>Quantity (sheets or m²) and destination port for FOB quote</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Price reference</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Product</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Spec</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Price Range (USD/m²)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">MOQ</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Lead Time</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Electro-galvanized roll</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">25×25mm, 1.2mm wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$3–6/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1 roll (30m)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10–15 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Hot-dip galvanized panel</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 2.5mm wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$6–12/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">PVC-coated panel (green)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×100mm, 3.0mm wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8–15/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Stainless 304 panel</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 2.0mm wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$15–28/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50 panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20–30 days</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*Indicative 2025–2026 ranges. Actual pricing depends on zinc cost, coating weight, order volume, and panel dimensions. Always request formal quotes.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">FAQ</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Roll vs panel — which is cheaper?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Rolls are cheaper per m² (less welding handling) but panels are faster to install and hold shape. For fences over 1.8 m high, panels are standard.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How long does hot-dip galvanizing last outdoors?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">With 60 g/m² zinc in a temperate climate, expect 15–20 years before red rust. Coastal or industrial air shortens this significantly — ask for 100+ g/m² or PVC coating.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Typical MOQ?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Stock panels: one bundle (~50–100 panels). Custom size/finish: usually 500+ panels. Anping factories often accept mixed container loads.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What's the difference between electro and hot-dip galvanizing?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary"><strong>Electro-galvanized:</strong> thin zinc layer (5–10 g/m²), smooth surface, cheaper, for indoor use. <strong>Hot-dip galvanized:</strong> thick zinc layer (40–60+ g/m²), matte gray, superior corrosion resistance for outdoor use. Always specify zinc weight in your PO.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Can I get custom panel sizes?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Yes. Anping factories cut panels to custom dimensions. Common max sizes: 2.0×3.0 m or 2.4×6.0 m. Larger panels may need special packaging and container loading plans.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How do I calculate panel weight for shipping?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Use our <a href="/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">welded mesh calculator</a> — enter opening size, wire diameter, panel dimensions to get kg per panel. For container planning, see the <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">container loading calculator</a>.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What quality checks should I perform on arrival?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Check: (1) wire diameter with caliper, (2) opening size with ruler, (3) zinc coating thickness with magnetic gauge, (4) weld strength by hand pressure, (5) surface for bare spots or coating defects. Request third-party inspection (SGS/BV) for large orders.</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">Get quotes from Anping welded mesh factories</p>
        <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Send an inquiry →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">QUICK TOOLS</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Calculate & Convert</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Weight Calculator
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/charts/mesh-size-chart/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Mesh Size Chart
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Container Loading
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB Price Calculator
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">QUICK SPECS</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Welded Mesh Standards</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Opening</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">6.4–300 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Wire Diameter</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.5–6.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Panel Size</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">1.22×2.44m<br/>2.0×3.0m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Zinc Coating</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">40–100 g/m²</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Material</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">Galv. Steel<br/>SS304/316</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Standards</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">ASTM A185<br/>ISO 6934</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">RELATED</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Related Products</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Stainless Steel Mesh
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/products/wire-mesh-fence-panels/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Fence Panels
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/products/gabion-baskets/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Gabion Baskets
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>
